    # "As we did so, Sypha called back to me once more."
    "우리가 그렇게 하자, 시파가 다시 한 번 나를 불렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:195
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_2c0ed6fd:

    # SYPHA @ happy "Oh, [player_name!t]."
    SYPHA @ happy "아, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:196
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_d19e2aea:

    # SYPHA @ happy "That reminds me..."
    SYPHA @ happy "그 말 들으니 생각났는데..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:197
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_a9501b8c:

    # SYPHA @ perv "{i}I look forward to claiming you!{/i}"
    SYPHA @ perv "{i}널 차지할 날이 기대되는구나!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:198
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_ecfc2d4f:

    # "As I pondered Sypha's words, Markus' hand grabbed me by the shoulder and pulled me away."
    "내가 시파의 말을 곱씹고 있을 때, 마커스의 손이 내 어깨를 잡아 나를 끌어당겼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:201
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_031db3f7:

    # MARKUS "Come on... Forget the witch."
    MARKUS  "어서... 그 마녀는 잊어버려."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:203
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_4a50fc82:

    # MARKUS "Let's get out of here."
    MARKUS  "여기서 나가자."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:205
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_bf2e3a2d_1:

    # SYPHA @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    SYPHA @ talk "{i}*한숨*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:207
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_3ab2961d:

    # SYPHA @ disgust "Have it your way, morons."
    SYPHA @ disgust "너희 마음대로 해라, 멍청이들."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:208
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_7e33e725:

    # "The sounds of footsteps drew closer and closer as Sypha continued to look at us with pure disappointment."
    "시파가 순수한 실망감을 담아 우리를 계속 바라보는 동안 발소리는 점점 더 가까이 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:210
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_ee686999:

    # "We hurried past her, heading back the way we came as quickly as we could before we were confronted by dozens of Demorai."
    "우리는 수십 명의 데모라이와 맞닥뜨리기 전에 최대한 빨리 왔던 길을 되돌아가며 그녀를 지나쳐 서둘렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:215
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_70c244f5:

    # MARKUS "FUCK!"
    MARKUS  "씨발!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:230
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_329b850a:

    # BLACK "More on their way."
    BLACK  "더 오고 있어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:231
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_5e2597f0:

    # MC "Bring it on, demon spawn!"
    MC  "덤벼라, 악마 새끼야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:232
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_16fbf62c:

    # BLACK "Bringing it on."
    BLACK  "덤비는 중."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:233
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_26787827:

    # MC "(That's not what I~)"
    MC  "(그런 뜻이 아닌데~)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:234
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_923941b2:

    # BLACK "Focus."
    BLACK  "집중해."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:244
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_1ccdb9ed:

    # "The dozens of bloodied, torn to shreds Demorai bodies littered the tunnel and piled up so high we had to clamber over the piles of their torn limbs to reach the outside."
    "피투성이가 되어 찢긴 수십 구의 데모라이 시체들이 터널에 흩어져 있었고, 찢긴 팔다리 더미 위로 기어올라야 밖으로 나갈 수 있을 정도로 높이 쌓였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:245
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_1975b4a8:

    # "Behind us, Sypha stood watching the whole thing."
    "우리 뒤에서, 시파가 모든 것을 지켜보며 서 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:246
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_b61029f4:

    # SYPHA @ talk "{i}...Fucking idiots.{/i}"
    SYPHA @ talk "{i}...멍청한 새끼들.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:248
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_42c67f47:

    # "We didn't want to waste anymore time, we could hear the sound of new stomping feet hurrying their way towards us, and quickly, we sprung our escape."
    "우리는 더 이상 시간을 낭비하고 싶지 않았고, 새로운 발걸음 소리가 우리를 향해 서둘러 오는 것을 들을 수 있었기에, 재빨리 탈출을 감행했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:249
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_fef66eab:

    # "We made our way back to Novaras as quickly as we could."
    "우리는 가능한 한 빨리 노바라스로 돌아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:250
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_000e2fa3:

    # "What we had seen left both of us shaken, our whole worlds as we understood it, collapsing around us."
    "우리가 본 것은 우리 둘 다를 충격에 빠뜨렸고, 우리가 이해하던 세계 전체가 우리 주위에서 무너지고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:251
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_496cf17b:

    # "Near by the gates of Novaras, we changed back into our human forms and picked up our clothes from where we left them."
    "노바라스 성문 근처에서, 우리는 인간 형태로 되돌아와 두고 갔던 옷을 집어 들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_2.rpy:252
translate kr qst_TwoEmperors_2_56d8eadb:

    # "In silence, we made our way back to the Gate."
    "침묵 속에, 우리는 성문으로 돌아갔다."

